{c_label}Cooldown:{/c} {c_resource}{Cooldown Time}{/c} seconds
{if:ADVANCED_TOOLTIP}{c_label}Lucky Hit Chance: {/c}{c_resource}[{Combat_Effect_Chance_Script_Formula_Override:1}|%|]{/c}
{/if}Place a trap that arms after {c_number}{buffduration:ARMING}{/c} seconds. It activates when an enemy moves within range, applying {c_number}{payload:TOOLTIP_DAMAGE}{/c} Poisoning damage over {c_number}{SF_2}{/c} seconds to enemies in the area.

You can have {c_number}{SF_10}{/c} armed traps out at once.{if:SF_25}

{c_important}Combo Points{/c} increase damage and improve Lucky Hit Chance:
{icon:bullet,1.2} {c_label}1 Point:{/c} {c_number}{payload:DAMAGE_TOOLTIP_1CP}{/c} damage, {c_number}[{SF_27}|%+|]{/c} chance
{icon:bullet,1.2} {c_label}2 Points:{/c} {c_number}{payload:DAMAGE_TOOLTIP_2CP}{/c} damage, {c_number}[{SF_27}*2|%+|]{/c} chance
{icon:bullet,1.2} {c_label}3 Points:{/c} {c_number}{payload:DAMAGE_TOOLTIP_3CP}{/c} damage, {c_number}[{SF_28}*{SF_27}*3|%+|]{/c} chance{/if}
